    Note over CS,CSMS: 1. Execute Reusable State GetInstalledCertificates<br>for certificateType CSMSRootCertificate.<br>The Test System responds with data hashed with SHA256.

    Note over CS,CSMS: 2. Execute Reusable State GetInstalledCertificates<br>for certificateType CSMSRootCertificate.<br>The Test System responds with data hashed with SHA384.

    Note over CS,CSMS: 3. Execute Reusable State GetInstalledCertificates<br>for certificateType CSMSRootCertificate.<br>The Test System responds with data hashed with SHA512.

